==Battleground==
*6 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Miss Haka]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*5 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Shigong Cat]] can wall this whole stage, while you use [[Ototo Corps|Holy Blast]] to constantly disrupt Miss Haka. Add in damagers like [[Housewife Cat]] and this stage should be cleared very easily.

